{"id":"vod_sn_39260","vodId":"39260","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"乱马12","name_cn":"乱马12","date":"1989-01-01","year":"1989","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/9430b47d4a329d91b897eb44fc9dae49.jpg"},"summary":"天道茜（日高法子 配音）和姐姐天道美（高山南 配音）、天道霞（井上喜久子 配音）以及父亲天道早云（大林隆介 配音）一起经营着属于他们的道场，一天，早乙女乱马（山口胜平 配音）和其父玄马（绪方贤一 配音）的到来打破了道场平静的生活。原来，和父亲在中国修炼的时候，乱马掉入了溺女泉，于是拥有了一碰冷水就会变身成女人的体质。在莫名其妙中，早云居然将小茜许配给了乱马，这让个性要强的小茜不能接受。　　乱马就读了当地的风林馆高中，在学校里，他遇见了诸多有趣的朋友和强大的对手，在每日打打闹闹的生活上，小茜和乱马之间的感情也产生了微妙的变化。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:08:42","playable":true,"episodeCount":18,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EUsJEd26QR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/K9RGqk4ARU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4UteeUhBhh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/KunDkieWGC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/MGNkPnvCdi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5UjKeWUmJL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hXeUAm263w1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JfyQYiLdgv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CmkAMe5PVS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1g8jw4Paf51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yk7FE7G3H31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ie6XVsyqRP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UZf3isje8N1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0uDJmRg0PN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.rstu